      "text": "What do we know about the estate, and what should we investigate next?"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.84,
      "end": 7.88,
      "text": "The Portfolio Discovery specialist uses Gemini to reason about heterogeneous"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.88,
      "end": 11.94,
      "text": "evidence, relationships, ambiguity, and missing facts."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.955,
      "end": 16.375000000000004,
      "text": "Structured output is validated before it reaches the workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.855,
      "end": 21.335000000000004,
